WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.574
The International Space Station.

00:03.274 --> 00:08.680
About the size of a football pitch, and moving at nearly eight kilometres a second.

00:09.130 --> 00:16.713
It goes all the way round the Earth every ninety-three minutes, so the crew see fifteen or sixteen sunrises a day.
